    "title": "Crittenden Girls Top Madisonville-North Hopkins 61-50 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Josh Nichols ,\n11 hours ago The Crittenden County Lady Rockets, winners of 10 of their last 11 contests, topped hosts Madisonville-North Hopkins 61-50 on Tuesday to improve to 21-5. The Lady Rockets bounced back from a loss to Henderson County with their second straight victory, while the Lady Maroons dropped their fourth in a row to slip to 10-14. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
